    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, the wait times are crazy and it's expensive. i've taken benadryl for hives before and it works fine. if i take a double dose like 50mg or something, would that be enough to clear up the throat tightness so i can just stay home? it's probably just a mild reaction right?",
